/Title (We are pleased to welcome Mr. Muhindo Aladin to our school community as a Primary Science and Mathematics Teacher. With a teaching experience of over 8 years, Mr. Muhindo brings his enthusiasm for learning and a commitment to helping young learners develop strong academic foundations. We are excited to have him join our team and look forward to the positive impact he will make. Welcome to Gill International School.)
