/Title (We welcome Ms. Sophie Nuwagira Bamwoyeraki to our school community as our new Head of Academics. An accomplished education consultant, teacher trainer and curriculum specialist, Ms. Sophie brings extensive experience in educational leadership, curriculum development and teacher professional development from various International schools such as Rainbow International School Uganda, Kampala international School Uganda and Sycamore International School. We look forward to benefiting from her expertise, leadership and passion for academic excellence.)
