/Title (We are delighted to welcome Ms. Harriet Akello to Gill International School this year. With over 10 years of teaching experience, she will be teaching Geography, History, and Humanities in the Lower Secondary, while also serving as the Year 10 Homeroom Teacher. We are excited to have her join our team and look forward to the knowledge and experience she will bring to our learners.)
